WEBVTT

00:05.540 --> 00:09.130
The complete law compendium of our country,
the Kingdom of Freesia.

00:09.750 --> 00:15.080
With my last boss cheat ability, I can remember
something perfectly after only reading it once,

00:15.380 --> 00:19.000
but I'm trying to deepen my understanding
by reading it over again periodically.

00:20.540 --> 00:25.670
In the game, starting with the Fealty Contract,
Pride even went as far as taking advantage of the law,

00:25.670 --> 00:29.210
and committed all kinds of atrocities.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.290
That itself is exactly why I want to learn
and make sure that I don't make a mistake.

00:35.670 --> 00:40.210
Not to use the law for evil, but so
I can protect the people of this country...

00:49.330 --> 00:51.420
How pretty, what book is it?

00:52.210 --> 00:56.250
It has a lot of directions on how
to make nice floral decorations.

00:59.130 --> 01:01.790
Sh-she's so cute!

02:34.040 --> 02:39.580
Now that I think about it, three years ago
when I first guided Tiara to the library as well...

02:41.790 --> 02:47.670
Tiara always likes cute, sweet
stories with happy endings.

02:49.540 --> 02:51.130
She's a typical protagonist.

02:53.000 --> 02:55.250
Tiara, which prince do you like?

02:56.210 --> 02:59.210
Hmm... This one!

03:02.500 --> 03:06.250
This prince looks a little bit like Big Brother.

03:07.500 --> 03:08.380
Does he?

03:11.170 --> 03:15.420
This is going great!
Maybe we've settled on the Stale route!

03:16.670 --> 03:21.000
And also, his princess looks
a little bit like you, Big Sister!

03:24.830 --> 03:25.920
Stale?!

03:27.670 --> 03:29.040
I'm sorry.

03:29.290 --> 03:31.880
Are you hurt, Big Brother?

03:32.290 --> 03:34.250
No, I'm fine.

03:39.380 --> 03:41.580
It looked like the two of them, how cute.

03:43.210 --> 03:47.580
It seemed that Stale was shocked since
the princess looked like me, though...

03:48.790 --> 03:53.290
<b>"The Selfish Princess Passes Judgment"</b>

03:49.380 --> 03:53.670
I'm sorry for calling you so suddenly,
my beloved daughters.

03:54.290 --> 03:57.670
Not at all, Mother. What would you like me to do?

03:58.790 --> 04:04.880
Have you heard about the man that was apprehended
concerning the incident with the knights the other day?

04:05.250 --> 04:05.880
Yes.

04:06.630 --> 04:10.500
We know that man, or to be exact, that man's troupe,

04:10.500 --> 04:14.710
is deeply involved with the disappearance
of the knights from the neighboring country.

04:15.170 --> 04:19.710
They were hired by an opposing faction of
our country's alliance with the Anemone Kingdom,

04:19.710 --> 04:22.790
and they first took the knights of
the Anemone Kingdom captive.

04:23.460 --> 04:28.500
They obtained information from them, and set up
the surprise attack on the cliff in question.

04:29.290 --> 04:34.380
Incidentally, the man had almost no intel
about the faction of the person who hired them,

04:34.380 --> 04:35.750
and they remain unidentified.

04:36.250 --> 04:41.130
Pride. I heard from Albert that you have been learning
about the laws of our country of your own volition,

04:41.130 --> 04:43.960
and are deepening your knowledge of them.

04:45.080 --> 04:46.130
If that is the case...

04:49.130 --> 04:52.000
You shall pass the judgment, as the future queen.

04:59.380 --> 05:01.920
The criminal's name is Val.

05:05.380 --> 05:07.790
I know him.

05:08.540 --> 05:11.250
He's the Earthen Wall special ability user, Val.

05:11.830 --> 05:17.040
He is one of the people hired by Queen Pride
in order to obstruct Tiara's path in the game.

05:18.210 --> 05:23.210
If I hadn't noticed him on that cliff,
I couldn't have saved the Captain of the Knights.

05:25.540 --> 05:30.880
According to this man, the knights of the Anemone
Kingdom who have been taken captive are still alive.

05:31.670 --> 05:34.790
However, in the event that they are being shackled,

05:34.790 --> 05:38.750
then they're in a place where
they can't be found without his guidance.

05:39.420 --> 05:45.330
Pride. First, state what you are considering
about how to deal with the criminal.

05:46.750 --> 05:47.540
Oh no...

05:48.130 --> 05:51.250
An attempt to test my capabilities as the future queen...

05:52.540 --> 05:54.830
Then I have to show them now.

05:56.500 --> 06:03.710
In the future, I'm sure Tiara will need to make tough
decisions sometimes when she become the true queen.

06:06.830 --> 06:09.460
The attack of the knights is a serious crime.

06:10.000 --> 06:13.000
At best, eternal imprisonment, at worst, execution...

06:13.420 --> 06:18.630
When I consider the possibility that this may have
shaken our alliance, execution may be appropriate.

06:20.250 --> 06:25.540
However, provided that he knows the place where
the captive knights of the Anemone Kingdom are,

06:25.540 --> 06:27.710
a Fealty Contract will apply.

06:28.130 --> 06:30.210
There are three punishments I can come up with.

06:30.540 --> 06:35.880
The first: Act is if we know nothing about
the captives and have you executed.

06:36.880 --> 06:39.750
The second: The Fealty Contract is put into effect,

06:39.750 --> 06:43.420
we will get information from you
under your unconditional obedience,

06:43.420 --> 06:45.960
and after we save the knights, you will be executed.

06:46.630 --> 06:52.000
The third: If you are under a Fealty Contract,
I can forbid you from any wrongdoing hereafter.

06:52.540 --> 06:54.540
You will be released after the knights' rescue.

06:55.040 --> 06:56.580
And that may be it.

06:57.540 --> 07:01.210
If this were my previous life, I couldn't say
something like this so bluntly.

07:01.460 --> 07:03.040
I couldn't make this decision either.

07:03.540 --> 07:07.960
I really am the cruel and atrocious Queen Pride.

07:08.960 --> 07:12.750
Now then, among those, please choose
the most appropriate punishment.

07:13.250 --> 07:18.000
We leave the ruling of what will happen
to that criminal up to you, as the first princess.

07:18.630 --> 07:22.210
First of all, we should rescue
the knights of the Anemone Kingdom.

07:22.630 --> 07:25.130
We cannot abandon those who have survived.

07:25.960 --> 07:32.130
When that happens, we'll decide if you will
be executed or not after the Fealty Contract.

07:33.290 --> 07:35.420
He won't walk free after what he's done.

07:35.880 --> 07:39.670
A crime that not even death can redeem... But...

07:41.290 --> 07:43.170
Take off his gag.

07:45.500 --> 07:46.540
Big Sister...

07:47.000 --> 07:47.880
It's all right.

07:51.580 --> 07:54.500
If you speak on unnecessary things,
you will be executed on the spot.

07:54.880 --> 07:56.880
Answer only my questions.

07:57.330 --> 08:01.880
You're called Val, I believe.
Which sort of punishment do you wish for?

08:03.040 --> 08:07.880
Once you have entered a Fealty Contract,
you can no longer perpetrate any crimes.

08:08.250 --> 08:10.210
You are not permitted to leave the country,

08:10.210 --> 08:17.170
nor can you resist or retaliate with your fists if you are
attacked or something precious is taken from you.

08:17.790 --> 08:21.460
Depending on how you live, a bitter hell worse
than even death could be waiting for you.

08:32.540 --> 08:41.500
I... don't want to die. I'll do anything... even serve you.

08:42.250 --> 08:43.380
Understood.

08:45.130 --> 08:48.710
After he has served his Fealty Contract, release him.

08:49.580 --> 08:53.080
Pride, that is your decision, yes?

08:54.210 --> 08:58.750
You have now, as the first princess,
passed judgement on that man.

08:59.130 --> 09:04.380
That being the case, you will also
carry out the Fealty Contract here.

09:10.670 --> 09:14.630
It's scary... to be in complete control of someone's life...

09:15.710 --> 09:22.210
In 7 years, the diabolical Queen Pride will ruin
the lives of all of her subjects in the country.

09:23.880 --> 09:27.710
If this is the start of my crimes, then...

09:29.580 --> 09:30.330
But...

09:36.210 --> 09:41.750
The Fealty Contract has taken effect.
These are the written orders for the criminal.

09:47.580 --> 09:52.000
I, First Princess Pride Royal Ivy,
as the master, decree the following:

09:52.710 --> 09:56.750
One; You will not disobey the orders
of any member of the royal family.

09:57.500 --> 10:01.330
Two; You will show deference to the entire royal family.

10:01.880 --> 10:05.710
Three; You may not leave the country
without your master's permission.

10:06.000 --> 10:09.540
Four; You will may not engage in violence,
even in self-defense.

10:09.920 --> 10:14.290
Five; You must live only on
the money you've worked for and earned.

10:17.170 --> 10:22.040
About the Anemone Kingdom knights that are being
held prisoner, it seems they've been safely rescued.

10:22.330 --> 10:24.210
Ah... Wonderful news.

10:26.080 --> 10:30.500
Pride. I will accompany your talk with that criminal later.

10:31.080 --> 10:31.830
Huh?

10:32.170 --> 10:35.000
Hereafter, when you have any
sort of important conversation,

10:35.000 --> 10:39.670
when you meet with Mother or Father,
or Chancellor Gilbert, call for me as well.

10:40.500 --> 10:42.960
Every time, no matter what it's for.

10:43.920 --> 10:44.880
Stale...

10:45.710 --> 10:47.670
Okay. I'll do that.

10:49.460 --> 10:51.540
Val, tell me.

10:52.130 --> 10:56.210
Here and now is the only time
that I will allow you to insult me.

10:56.580 --> 10:58.790
Please say what you want to say.

11:01.330 --> 11:02.290
You monster.

11:05.750 --> 11:07.960
I will release you now.

11:08.500 --> 11:11.040
How do you intend to live your life from here on?

11:12.580 --> 11:14.130
Haven't thought about it yet.

11:15.250 --> 11:16.170
Ah, I see.

11:16.830 --> 11:22.710
Now, I will give you two orders that
may be the last you will ever live by.

11:23.170 --> 11:23.880
What?

11:24.170 --> 11:29.040
First of all, if you ever detect that
there ever is an emergency situation,

11:30.210 --> 11:35.960
please use your special ability
to protect my dear little sister, Tiara.

11:37.460 --> 11:37.960
Huh?!

11:38.250 --> 11:40.210
Pride! What in the world are you...

11:40.330 --> 11:42.540
This is a matter of the highest priority.

11:42.880 --> 11:43.960
To that end...

11:44.750 --> 11:49.960
If it's for Tiara's sake, you have
permission to go against my orders.

11:50.580 --> 11:51.920
And the second...

11:51.920 --> 12:00.170
Val, if you are ever faced with an impossible situation,
and you wish from your heart for someone to help you,

12:00.540 --> 12:01.960
come back to me.

12:04.380 --> 12:07.580
That's it for my orders. You have been freed.

12:08.040 --> 12:09.790
Please leave this castle.

12:18.290 --> 12:19.500
Why're you doing this?!

12:19.960 --> 12:24.460
If you don't find yourself in that sort of situation,
then that order is nothing more than an unfounded fear.

12:24.750 --> 12:25.670
What?!

12:31.750 --> 12:34.380
Pride! Why did you give an order like that?!

12:34.960 --> 12:40.880
Well... I mean, if he gets caught up in anything,
due to the Fealty Contract he can't escape to-

12:40.880 --> 12:43.420
That's exactly what that criminal deserves!

12:44.040 --> 12:50.790
You're right... But, because I freed him
he's become one of my subjects again, so...

12:54.000 --> 12:55.290
The criminal Val...

12:56.500 --> 12:59.040
If he wishes to live even though he is one...

13:00.170 --> 13:04.420
I thought there'd be no harm
in giving him at least one more chance...

13:05.290 --> 13:08.210
I'm expected to commit even worse crimes than he has,

13:08.540 --> 13:15.500
and if we are in a country where I am allowed to live
like this, surrounded by the people most dear to me...

13:19.170 --> 13:20.290
I understand.

13:20.750 --> 13:23.290
Since that is the type of person you are,

13:24.580 --> 13:27.540
it's fine as long as I can keep a watchful eye
over those ongoings of yours.

13:29.170 --> 13:30.170
Big Sister?

13:30.830 --> 13:31.670
Huh?!

13:32.330 --> 13:37.380
Is... Is my being here a hindrance to you?

13:37.830 --> 13:42.170
What?! Of course it isn't! Why would you think that?

13:42.500 --> 13:47.830
Big Sister, you're the one who will become queen.
You should be protected more than anyone.

13:49.920 --> 13:55.210
But even so, you demand that I'm protected.
Is it because I'm weak?

13:57.540 --> 13:59.130
I'm sorry, Tiara.

13:59.830 --> 14:04.630
You're a very precious person to me,
so I was only thinking of protecting you.

14:06.330 --> 14:10.790
I love you, Tiara. You're my only sister...

14:11.250 --> 14:16.040
No matter what happens in the future,
my feelings right now are genuine.

14:17.040 --> 14:18.790
Please, believe only that!

14:19.750 --> 14:21.830
I will, Big Sister.

14:26.170 --> 14:28.790
And I love you too, Stale.

14:29.750 --> 14:36.500
My precious younger brother... Whatever may happen,
please let me be your older sister until the very end.

14:38.460 --> 14:41.670
Big Sister, what sort of prince do you like?

14:42.540 --> 14:47.460
Let me see... I think I like this more than a prince.

14:48.670 --> 14:53.880
Because being with my beloved
Tiara and Stale is happiness.

14:54.880 --> 15:00.330
Then if the three of us stay together,
we can live happily for ever and ever, right?

15:01.750 --> 15:04.210
Please, I want you to remember that.

15:04.920 --> 15:08.170
Even if in the future, I'm found guilty...

15:09.080 --> 15:13.040
Remember only, right here and now,
that I loved you both.

15:19.750 --> 15:22.080
Ah, Big Sister! Over there!

15:24.500 --> 15:27.500
Sorry I've kept you waiting, Elder Sister, Tiara.

15:28.670 --> 15:29.290
Hm?

15:30.330 --> 15:33.000
P...Princess Pride... is here?!

15:33.540 --> 15:37.630
Yes. Sorry I didn't tell you. I invited her.

15:37.630 --> 15:38.670
Let me know!

15:39.170 --> 15:43.540
Arthur. Thank you for agreeing
to become Stale's training partner.

15:44.210 --> 15:49.130
Both Tiara and I are pleased that
we'll be able to see you every day from here on.

15:49.580 --> 15:50.500
Every day?

15:50.500 --> 15:51.750
Yes, absolutely.

15:51.750 --> 15:52.170
Eh?

15:52.170 --> 15:56.920
It is the greatest encouragement for us to
be able to watch over Elder Sister and Tiara, too.

15:57.290 --> 15:58.540
Isn't that right, Arthur?

16:00.500 --> 16:02.040
If we're in your way...

16:02.040 --> 16:03.880
You're not in our way!

16:04.040 --> 16:05.040
Great!

16:05.460 --> 16:09.330
Can I sit and watch you two as well, Arthur?

16:09.960 --> 16:11.420
Yes... Princess Tiara.

16:12.000 --> 16:16.790
Pride. Please watch us. I'll show you
that I'll get stronger than I am now!

16:17.710 --> 16:20.500
Me too. I will make sure I become a knight!

16:22.580 --> 16:26.750
We'll support you the entire way, Stale and Arthur.

16:53.920 --> 16:58.000
Hey, what's the deal, Stale!
You've been fighting only on the defense for a while now!

16:58.000 --> 17:02.830
It's not looking very good for your exam to
become a knight if you can't overpower me, Arthur!

17:08.250 --> 17:11.130
We picked a whole lot today, Big Sister!

17:12.540 --> 17:17.880
Yes. Let's get back to the other two.

17:18.790 --> 17:20.580
Whoa, amazing!

17:20.960 --> 17:23.920
Are these... presents for us?

17:24.380 --> 17:29.000
They are! This is for you, Big Brother,
and these are for Arthur!

17:29.630 --> 17:31.880
Wow... Thanks, Tiara.

17:32.330 --> 17:34.630
Big Sister chose them!

17:35.250 --> 17:36.460
You did, Princess Pride?

17:36.960 --> 17:40.500
I chose the flower language that suited each one of us.

17:41.540 --> 17:43.130
Tell them all about it, Big Sister!

17:43.580 --> 17:44.460
Okay.

17:46.210 --> 17:48.130
For Stale's flower language,

17:48.130 --> 17:53.710
there's "intelligent", "one who puts effort into being
successful" , "bonds thicker than blood", and...

17:54.000 --> 17:56.000
"I want to be worthy of you".

17:56.630 --> 18:02.290
Because I want to become a suitable older sister
and queen for a wonderful regent like Stale.

18:08.170 --> 18:08.960
Hey!

18:09.460 --> 18:14.000
For Arthur: "heroic", "earnest", "strong and beautiful",

18:14.500 --> 18:17.670
also, "I love the oath you made that day."

18:18.080 --> 18:19.130
Argh!

18:20.540 --> 18:24.420
It seems that originally those words referred
to wedding vows and things like that...

18:24.750 --> 18:27.130
but looking at the meaning itself...

18:27.500 --> 18:31.000
I'm cheering for you on
your next exam to become a knight!

18:34.960 --> 18:37.710
Maybe I said too much with those embarrassing lines...?

18:39.250 --> 18:41.080
Flower language is beautiful, isn't it?

18:41.500 --> 18:42.790
Thank you so much!

18:45.130 --> 18:48.630
In addition, Tiara made something very lovely.

18:53.460 --> 18:54.170
Wow!

18:54.670 --> 18:55.830
This is amazing!

18:56.210 --> 19:00.250
But I ran out of time and couldn't make one for Big Sister.

19:01.290 --> 19:03.330
Do you and Arthur want to try making one?

19:15.630 --> 19:19.670
Those two... They look so happy being taught by Tiara.

19:26.290 --> 19:30.210
Impressive, you two! They're both so lovely!

19:31.920 --> 19:32.540
Huh?

19:33.670 --> 19:34.460
Oh...

19:35.670 --> 19:39.380
Since Tiara said she couldn't make one for you...

19:39.710 --> 19:41.710
If you don't mind, take these!

19:42.630 --> 19:44.630
For me? Are you sure?

19:45.250 --> 19:46.670
It really does suit you.

19:46.830 --> 19:50.540
Please let Big Brother and Arthur crown you!

20:09.040 --> 20:10.170
How is it?

20:11.000 --> 20:11.960
It's beautiful!

20:13.790 --> 20:16.500
But, these flowers...

20:17.500 --> 20:18.170
Huh?!

20:22.250 --> 20:25.630
Yes. They truly suit you two better
than anyone else in the world!

20:53.290 --> 20:54.460
It's time.

20:54.830 --> 20:55.790
Yeah.

21:01.000 --> 21:03.630
Princess Pride, I'm taking leave now.

21:04.330 --> 21:06.000
Best of luck, Arthur!

21:06.380 --> 21:08.040
We'll be cheering for you!

21:12.330 --> 21:14.460
You're going with the flower?

21:17.710 --> 21:21.130
Shut up! I'll take it off outside of the practice field!

21:24.080 --> 21:25.880
My heart is racing a little.

21:26.580 --> 21:29.250
Pride, we should head to the field as well.

21:29.250 --> 21:30.000
Right.

21:34.250 --> 21:37.170
Pride Royal Ivy, age 13.

21:38.210 --> 21:43.380
When I realized it, my world had
gotten much, much more colorful

21:44.130 --> 21:46.330
than it was at that time five years ago.

23:28.420 --> 23:34.540
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:35.250 --> 23:39.080
Episode 7: "The Coldhearted Princess and the Quitter".

23:36.210 --> 23:41.040
<b>"The Coldhearted Princess and the Quitter"</b>
